### 4. POST /logs - Crear log amb dades invàlides (Cas d'error -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Accept-Encoding: deflate, gzip, x-gzip
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: IntelliJ HTTP Request/IntelliJ IDEA 2026.2.3
Content-Length: 60

{
  "nivell": "INVALID_LEVEL",
  "servei": "auth-service"
}
